OL,3,GNEWSALicence granted for September
OL,4,Amusic festival
OL,5,
OL,6,FA music festival has been given the go
OL,7,Fahead to operate in September after
OL,8,Forganisers postponed the event due to
OL,9,F"compliance issues."
OL,11,FOrganisers of Existance festival near
OL,12,FTetbury, previously got a licence for
OL,13,FJune, despite a number of concerns
OL,14,Fraised, but was postponed.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
