OL,3,GNEWSALicence granted for September
OL,4,Amusic festival
OL,5,
OL,6,FIssues raised from parish councils and
OL,7,Fresidents included fire risk, noise
OL,8,Fpollution and environmental impact, but
OL,9,Fno issues were raised by the fire
OL,10,Fservice, police or utility services,
OL,11,Fwith festival organisers saying they
OL,12,Fhad put together a very extensive
OL,13,Fmanagement plan for the event.
OL,15,F"I'm happy to get the licence approved,
OL,16,Fwe're looking to run a safe yet
OL,17,Fcomplaint event," Daniel Wilde,
OL,18,FExistance organiser said.
